tions are no longer available here. Your saved listing and application history remain accessible.', 'Cette opportunité est clôturée. Il n’est plus possible de postuler ici. Vos favoris et votre historique de candidature restent accessibles.') }}</p><a v-if="opportunity.is_open" href="#application-options" class="cta cta-primary w-full mt-5 lg:hidden">{{ text('View application options', 'Voir comment postuler') }}</a></header>
                <section class="bg-white border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-2">{{ text('About this opportunity', 'À propos de cette opportunité') }}</h2><p v-if="opportunity.original_language_label" class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-5">{{ opportunity.translated ? text(`Translated from ${opportunity.original_language_label} by AI. The original is below.`, `Traduit par IA (langue d’origine : ${opportunity.original_language_label}). L’original est plus bas.`) : text(`Posted in ${opportunity.original_language_label}.`, `Publiée en ${opportunity.original_language_label}.`) }}</p><div v-else class="mb-5"></div><div :lang="opportunity.translated ? page.props.locale : opportunity.language || undefined" dir="auto" class="whitespace-pre-line text-base text-slate-700 leading-8 break-words">{{ opportunity.description }}</div><details v-if="opportunity.original" class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-paper-2 group"><summary class="cursor-pointer list-none px-5 py-4 font-semibold text-navy flex items-center justify-between gap-3 focus-ring rounded-xl">{{ text(`Original listing (${opportunity.original.label || 'original language'})`, `Offre d’origine (${opportunity.original.label || 'langue d’origine'})`) }}<span aria-hidden="true" class="text-blue-700 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-xl leading-none">+</span></summary><div :lang="opportunity.original.language || undefined" dir="auto" class="px-5 pb-5"><p class="font-display text-lg font-semibold">{{ opportunity.original.title }}</p><div class="whitespace-pre-line text-[15px] text-slate-700 leading-7 break-words mt-3">{{ opportunity.original.description }}</div></div></details><div v-if="opportunity.skills?.length" class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-6"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold mb-4">{{ text('Skills and expertise', 'Compétences') }}</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span v-for="skill in opportunity.skills" :key="skill" class="bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold">{{ skill }}</span></div></div><div v-if="opportunity.attachments?.length" class="mt-8 border-t border-line pt-6"><h2 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold mb-4">{{ text('Opportunity attachments', 'Pièces jointes') }}</h2><a v-for="attachment in opportunity.attachments" :key="attachment.url" :href="attachment.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center gap-2 py-2 text-blue-700 break-all"><Download :size="18" />{{ attachment.name }}</a></div></section>
                <ApplicationKitPanel v-if="showKit" :opportunity="opportunity" :kits="kits" :kit-locales="kitLocales" />
                <section v-if="hasPlaceDetails" class="bg-white border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-5">{{ text('Location and who can apply', 'Lieu et candidats acceptés') }}</h2><p v-if="whoCanApply" class="text-slate-700 leading-7 mb-5">{{ whoCanApply }}</p><dl class="space-y-4 text-sm"><div v-if="opportunity.locations?.length"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Work locations', 'Lieux de travail') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1"><ul><li v-for="(location, index) in opportunity.locations" :key="index">{{ location.location || [location.city, location.country_code && countryName(location.country_code)].filter(Boolean).join(', ') }}</li></ul></dd></div><div v-if="opportunity.start_date"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Start date', 'Date de début') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1">{{ formatDay(opportunity.start_date) }}</dd></div><div v-if="opportunity.remote_scope"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Remote scope', 'Télétravail') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1">{{ opportunity.remote_scope }}</dd></div><div v-if="opportunity.eligible_countries?.length && opportunity.applicant_scope !== 'listed'"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Countries that can apply', 'Pays acceptés') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1">{{ countryList(opportunity.eligible_countries) }}</dd></div><div v-if="opportunity.excluded_countries?.length"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Countries that cannot apply', 'Pays exclus') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1">{{ countryList(opportunity.excluded_countries) }}</dd></div><div v-if="offered(opportunity.relocation)"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Relocation help', 'Aide à la relocalisation') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1">{{ offered(opportunity.relocation) }}</dd></div><div v-if="offered(opportunity.visa_sponsorship)"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Visa sponsorship', 'Parrainage de visa') }}</dt><dd class="text-slate-600 mt-1">{{ offered(opportunity.visa_sponsorship) }}</dd></div></dl></section>
                <section class="bg-white border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold mb-5">{{ text('Source and dates', 'Source et dates') }}</h2><dl class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 text-sm"><div><dt class="font-semibold">{{ opportunity.posted_at ? text('Originally posted', 'Publié à l’origine') : text('Added to Nextward', 'Ajouté sur Nextward') }}</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-slate-600">{{ opportunity.posted_label || opportunity.created_at || text('Date unavailable', 'Date indisponible') }}</dd></div><div><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Application deadline', 'Date limite de candidature') }}</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-slate-600">{{ deadline }}</dd></div><div><dt class="font-semibold">Source</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-slate-600"><a v-if="opportunity.source_url" :href="opportunity.source_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-700 underline" @click="markOpened(opportunity)" @auxclick="markOpened(opportunity)">{{ opportunity.source_name || text('Original listing', 'Offre d’origine') }}</a><span v-else>{{ text('Posted by the employer on Nextward', 'Publiée par l’employeur sur Nextward') }}</span></dd></div><div v-if="opportunity.origin === 'imported'"><dt class="font-semibold">{{ text('Last successful source check', 'Dernière vérification de la source') }}</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-slate-600">{{ opportunity.last_verified_label || text('Not yet verified', 'Pas encore vérifiée') }}</dd></div></dl></section>
            </div>
            <aside class="space-y-5 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:max-h-[calc(100dvh-7rem)] lg:overflow-y-auto [scrollbar-width:thin]">
                <section id="application-options" class="bg-white border border-line rounded-2xl p-6 scroll-mt-24"><p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold leading-snug mb-6">{{ payLabel }}</p>
                    <template v-if="ownsIt"><Link :href="route('opportunities.edit', opportunity.id)" class="cta cta-primary w-full">{{ text('Edit opportunity', 'Modifier l’opportunité') }}</Link><Link v-if="!external" :href="route('opportunities.applications.index', opportunity.id)" class="cta cta-secondary w-full mt-3">{{ text('Review applicants', 'Voir les candidats') }}</Link><button type="button" class="text-red-600 text-sm font-semibold mt-4 w-full" @click="remove">{{ text('Remove opportunity', 'Retirer l’opportunité') }}</button></template>
                    <template v-else>
                        <Link v-if="opportunity.application" :href="route('applications.show', opportunity.application.id)" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl bg-green-50 text-green-800 font-semibold mb-4"><Check :size="18" />{{ external ? text('View your application tracking', 'Voir le suivi de votre candidature') : text('View your application', 'Voir votre candidature') }}</Link>
                        <template v-if="opportunity.is_open">
                            <template v-if="external && opportunity.application_url"><a :href="opportunity.application_url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta cta-primary w-full" @click="markOpened(opportunity)" @auxclick="markOpened(opportunity)">{{ text('Apply on source website', 'Postuler sur le site de la source') }}<ArrowUpRight :size="18" /></a><p v-if="openedLabel" class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mt-3">{{ text('You opened this listing on', 'Vous avez ouvert cette offre le') }} {{ openedLabel }}.</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-6 mt-3">{{ text('Opens the employer’s page. Nothing is sent from Nextward.', 'Ouvre la page de l’employeur. Rien n’est envoyé depuis Nextward.') }}</p><button v-if="candidate && !opportunity.application" type="button" class="cta cta-secondary w-full mt-4" @click="confirming = !confirming">{{ text('I applied', 'J’ai postulé') }}</button><form v-if="confirming" class="mt-4 border-t border-line pt-4" @submit.prevent="track"><label class="block text-sm font-semibold">{{ text('Private notes (optional)', 'Notes privées (facultatif)') }}<textarea v-model="notes" maxlength="5000" rows="3" class="w-full border-line rounded-lg mt-2" /></label><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">{{ text('Confirm only after you have sent your application on the other website. This record is private and candidate-reported.', 'Confirmez seulement après avoir envoyé votre candidature sur l’autre site. Cette note est privée et déclarée par vous.') }}</p><button type="submit" :disabled="tracking" class="cta cta-primary w-full mt-3">{{ tracking ? text('Saving…', 'Enregistrement…') : text('Confirm I applied', 'Confirmer ma candidature') }}</button><p v-if="trackError" class="mt-2 text-sm text-red-700" role="alert">{{ trackError }}</p></form><Link v-if="!user" :href="`${publicPrefix}/login`" class="block mt-4 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">{{ text('Log in to track your application and keep your saves on every device', 'Connectez-vous pour suivre votre candidature et retrouver vos favoris sur tous vos appareils') }}</Link></template>
